        <item>
            <title>3.12.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 20:07:41 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>180</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.12.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- "Stay reachable remotely" now keeps the Mac awake only while at least one session is open. With no session open, the Mac can sleep normally. A busy session still keeps it awake as before.
- The sidebar footer's coffee cup now always shows the sleep state: filled while Canopy is keeping the Mac awake, an outline when it is not.

### Bug Fixes
- The MacroPad indicator in the sidebar footer was drawn much darker than intended. It now matches the coffee cup beside it.
- A session whose Claude process had crashed in the background could keep the Mac awake indefinitely under "Stay reachable remotely".
]]></description>
