        <item>
            <title>3.12.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:41:33 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>178</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.12.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The pending-update popover names Canopy versions (e.g. "Canopy 3.12.1 is installed; the session service still runs 3.12.0") instead of internal build numbers
- Phone notifications carry the session's name, so History keeps naming a session after it closes (needs the matching Canopy Mobile update)

### Bug Fixes
- A session whose worktree was removed from another session or a terminal, after the session had moved back to the main checkout, opened with an empty conversation on the phone. It now moves to the checkout and resumes there, at the end of its next turn or when a phone or another Mac attaches
]]></description>
